{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"98b071d680a57ed244b27b896b0b0254ac13dc9fb07b8851729c5035a8d0c237","ja":"この先、3つの試練が待ち構えているわ。\nすべてを乗り越えたら、セクシーを極めた証をあげる。","zh":"前方正有3个考验在等待着你。\n若是能克服这一切，我就会赐予你穷究性感境界的证明。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bc59b27532e8cb3f896a839b5eab67333709a065acb996209bd45f746e9089af","ja":"……って言われたけど、\nここで待ってればいいのかしら？","zh":"……虽然对方是这么说的，\n在这里等着就行了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ebcf0ee927e8be935162623b208cedbbf0547eaf01c06352ca846e1a77ddefae","ja":"第1の試練の場にようこそ。\nこれから私が、第2の試練の場にご案内いたします。","zh":"欢迎来到第1个考验之地。\n接下来将由我带您前往第2个考验之地。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"be94e5ffda70e0504db6a78ff3a1d1383e371dcb7fd52e3b95605cf1981a7e0a","ja":"えっ！？　第1の試練はもうクリアなの？","zh":"咦！？　第1个试炼已经通关了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e54efd0fdb30b7917b8b636fc35f1328706cb9616eaef6314e6f6709cb8d2823","ja":"いいえ。次の試練の場まで、\n私についてこれたらクリアです。","zh":"不。只要能跟着我到达\n下一处试炼之地，就算通关了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"0909b28431e2c9c3dc976618b9382cb99fca4b21ebb876931ded908a8b31a420","ja":"それでは、第1の試練を開始します！\n気合いと根性でついてきてくださいね！","zh":"那么，第1个考验现在开始！\n请凭着干劲与毅力跟上来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"46203270795288b4f2f0c182ba95d53c34add0a007a6442d68a05911a87aa1b1","ja":"えっ、もう始まるの！？\nちょ、ちょっと待って！！","zh":"咦，这就开始了吗！？\n等、等一下！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"38ab66fcaa1218137643516377467731d8178ad0858287b91a1ffafea2fa688f","ja":"はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。","zh":"呼、呼、呼……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a60cd47abc96417d3e3637a88cab8c00f5960d6f8c04db5fd0cb5a8485f65765","ja":"ずいぶんお疲れのようですね。\nそろそろリタイアしますか？","zh":"您看起来已经相当疲倦了呢。\n要不要就此放弃？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"80806591a7f2f7ff47d6af4b51b4a0ec4731a2fe9eb5b61d3d1da0b137d82d57","ja":"……はぁ、はぁ。ま、まだまだよ……。\nこれくらいでセクシーを諦めるわけにはいかないわ！","zh":"……哈啊、哈啊。还、还没完呢……。\n我怎么能因为这种程度就放弃性感呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"0b97783f31d901a8f00cbc739d6a2f9b4d622bcb5b4a4eea8ce0aaade675993d","ja":"……ふふっ♪\n素晴らしい根性ですね。それでは続けましょう。","zh":"……呵呵♪\n毅力很值得赞赏呢。那么，我们继续吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"6dc1983674b014974966029ee2fb2c2d30ded202b5a1e2c5c2ec0a28f32aa75b","ja":"第2の試練の場に到着しました。\nお見事、第1の試練達成です！","zh":"已到达第2个考验之地。\n干得漂亮，达成了第1个考验！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"7d848e635f05967d7b92768697b79c2bb826e367a27fd5b9f99dbe13d8dc34cd","ja":"それでは、私はこれで。","zh":"那么，我先告辞了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"d5274ad2a4a9d3bb906eb43fc2aaac6655f1c3b0111ba58753f41428eda9690d","ja":"……はぁ、はぁ。ここって……野球場？\nそれじゃあ、第2の試練ってもしかして……。","zh":"……呼、呼。这里是……棒球场？\n这么说来，第2个试炼难道是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1303.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"d4c1bd3e96c63efb2f3969fc2e57260370791311c07deb1ddf1f2ea53c93d5f4","ja":"へへっ、よく来たな！　これから第2の試練だぜ！\n試練の内容は……1万本ノックだ！","zh":"嘿嘿，你来得正好！接下来是第2个考验！\n考验的内容是……1万次击球防守练习！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
